00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:14.290
components to some of this data.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:17.859
First of all, GDP, you might remember that
about a month ago we got

00:00:17.859 --> 00:00:23.500
the first quarter GDP estimate, which was
a decline of four point eight percent.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.890
It's now been updated often in the 30 days
after the estimate.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.599
We get an updated GDP number.

00:00:28.599 --> 00:00:35.800
The first quarter GDP number has been made
worse by being increased to a five percent

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.570
shrinking of gross domestic product during
the first quarter.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:42.450
Now, in a moment, Locksley net in a moment.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:49.530
Right now, the White House is planning not
to release expectations for the second quarter.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:56.859
And this is part of the Proactiv propaganda
attempt to cover up historically unconscionably

00:00:56.859 --> 00:01:02.930
bad economic numbers that we are going to
get at the end of July and into the end of

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.580
August, during into the end of August, about
the second quarter.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:11.190
The White House clearly seeing the writing
on the wall and they are not going to be publicizing

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.540
these expectations.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:13.540
They will get them from

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:17.340
their economic teams, but they will not be
